Each bracket type has a stack, reset at document boundaries. Short curly
spans give large negative values; longer spans weaken or reverse this.
Square/angle closers are weaker. Spaces, line breaks, repeated closers and
adjacent punctuation modify the response. Early unmatched curly/square
